  "en": "data/site_data.json: old (Turkish) paths -> new (English) paths, and the values that changed. paths: every renamed key path ('[]' = any list element); values: per new path pattern, old value -> new value ('[i]' = position i of a row); prose: text values that quoted an old path; site_only: keys that exist only in site_data. Written by python tools/metric_renames.py site-map --out docs/site-data-renames.json from docs/metric-key-renames.json.",
